  "scope": "the I64 intent-contract fixture: one pending batch with a finalize deadline e; a challenge extends the deadline of the pending batch by W (as Rollup.sol:489-493 extends every other unfinalized batch), and cancelling the challenge leaves the extension: O12's residue in miniature"
